<view class="container">
  <view class="page-title">教案 / 课程包</view>
  <view class="page-sub">管理可售教案：含多少课次、适用年级、大纲</view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="card" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="row">
        <view>
          <view class="item-title">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted">{{item.subject}} · {{item.grade}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="tag {{item.status === '上架' ? 'ok' : 'warn'}}">{{item.status}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="meta row">
        <text class="strong">{{item.lessonCount}} 课次</text>
        <text class="price">¥{{item.price}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="muted outline">大纲：{{item.outlineText}}</view>
      <view class="ops">
        <button class="btn-ghost mini" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onToggle">
          {{item.status === '上架' ? '下架' : '上架'}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section card tip-card">
    <view class="section-title">怎么用</view>
    <view class="muted">1. 教务在这里维护教案（产品）</view>
    <view class="muted">2. 家长引导时勾选「买了哪个教案」</view>
    <view class="muted">3. 后续排课/消课扣的是报读里的剩余课次</view>
  </view>

  <role-nav current="/pages/academic/courses/courses" />
</view>
